{"name": "Origins Trading Card Game", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Origins TCG is a fast-paced competitive card game with limited edition cards. Outsmart opponents, collect iconic characters like Mulan &amp; Robin Hood, and trade to build the ultimate collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every turn is both players' turn. Outplay your rivals in ~7 minutes. Battle in 3 lanes with unique conditions so no two games feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rip packs. Trade dupes. Collect digital graded cards. Every pack is full of limited edition legends with marketplace value.<br/> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/8c6ecebe2a2a8d031c68cf18c2e901e6.poster.avif?t=1793123931\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/8c6ecebe2a2a8d031c68cf18c2e901e6.webm?t=1793123931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/8c6ecebe2a2a8d031c68cf18c2e901e6.mp4?t=1793123931\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>The best competitive games start with a level playing field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That\u2019s why every Origins player can earn all the cards they need to build competitive decks, for free. Spending money will never unlock stronger cards or give you an advantage in gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/4aee00a5e5a5bc3325207d25020ab6f5.poster.avif?t=1793123931\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/4aee00a5e5a5bc3325207d25020ab6f5.webm?t=1793123931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/4aee00a5e5a5bc3325207d25020ab6f5.mp4?t=1793123931\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Collect rare, hand-drawn cosmetic variants of your favorite cards, then trade them with other players in the marketplace. Rip limited-edition collectibles, chase legendary pulls, and discover grail cards prized for their artistry and rarity, not their gameplay power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/0c1baa5b6d6af4a576061e773bbe708c.poster.avif?t=1793123931\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/0c1baa5b6d6af4a576061e773bbe708c.webm?t=1793123931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/0c1baa5b6d6af4a576061e773bbe708c.mp4?t=1793123931\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Both players move at once. Simultaneous turns means no more waiting for your opponent to take their turn. Draw, predict, and battle across three dynamic locations. Outplay your opponent in ~7 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/deb05eee0f05784ccd462b6ed82b8512.poster.avif?t=1793123931\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/deb05eee0f05784ccd462b6ed82b8512.webm?t=1793123931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/deb05eee0f05784ccd462b6ed82b8512.mp4?t=1793123931\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Every match draws from a pool of 100+ rotating locations that reshape the board and demand a unique strategy. Easy to learn, difficult to master. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/8085005ff670a1dbdf751a570955034b.poster.avif?t=1793123931\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/8085005ff670a1dbdf751a570955034b.webm?t=1793123931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/extras/8085005ff670a1dbdf751a570955034b.mp4?t=1793123931\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Origins is an original world inspired by history's most iconic characters like Robin Hood, Queen of Hearts, &amp; Winnie-the-Pooh. Earth got their names right and everything else wrong. Now the portals are open, and only the worthy may enter.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Outplay rivals in a fast PvP card game where both players move at once. Adapt your strategy and battle for three of 100+ rotating locations. Build decks with reimagined legends like Robin Hood and Mulan. Every competitive card is free. Rip packs for rare, limited-edition variants to trade on Steam.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429430/bf6af505939c39d6d4539c8fc6b0cdb061b1f623/header.jpg?t=1793123931", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Trading Card Game", "Card Battler", "Card Game", "PvP", "Free to Play"], "developers": "Koin Games", "publishers": "Koin Games", "release_date": "Oct 27, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "4429430", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "27 October 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/JTkJYkV-NJY", "first_seen": 1793055600.0, "review_rank": 2}